t"},{"type":"text","text":"Clean. Committing on the assigned branch:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0c91390f853643bb8e2ae54e","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/96facee9fb96/container-recipe && git add container/ results/receipts/build.json && git commit -q -m \"container: recipe for flashnext:dev — pinned wheel set + engine fork built from source\n\nContainerfile (Ubuntu 24.04, py3.12 venv at /opt/venv), shape adapted from\nkyuz0/amd-strix-halo-vllm-toolboxes Dockerfile.ubuntu-repoamd (MIT notice in\nheader, per THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md):\n\n- substrate pinned from repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch: torch==2.13.0+rocm7.14.0,\n  torchvision==0.28.0+rocm7.14.0, triton==3.8.0+git4cff872c.rocm7.14.0 (the exact\n  companion pip resolves for torch 2.13.0), rocm-sdk-devel for the HIP compiler;\n  torchaudio omitted, not downgraded\n- finding: the generic torch/torchvision wheels ship no device kernels — first launch\n  dies hipErrorInvalidImage until amd-torch-device-gfx1151 / amd-torchvision-device-gfx1151\n  / rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151 are installed; pinned too\n- mecattaf/vllm branch flashnext cloned --depth 1 and built from source\n  (editable, --no-build-isolation, PYTORCH_ROCM_ARCH=gfx1151); a bind-mounted\n  checkout over /opt/vllm plus host ccache/pip caches (build.sh) make one-line\n  patch rebuilds incremental and the image enterable for edit-and-restart\n- container/rootfs/ overlay COPYs into site-packages (fn_ instruments land importable)\n- /opt/flashnext/build-info.json records fork commit, torch, triton, build time\n\nbuild.sh: packaging tests first, podman build flashnext:dev, receipt\nresults/receipts/build.json (fail status on any error). Attempt-2 fix per the\nmachine diagnosis: host ccache/pip cache defaults moved from \\$REPO_ROOT/.build/\nto \\${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-\\$HOME/.cache}/flashnext/{ccache,pip} so the worktree never\ngains untracked files outside container/ and results/receipts/; o